/*
 * $DOC$
 * $NAME$
 * wg_Row
 *
 * $ONELINER$
 * Lay out controls horizontally
 *
 * $SYNTAX$
 * wg_Row():New( oParent ) --> oRow
 *
 * $ARGUMENTS$
 * `oParent` Window or layout container.
 *
 * $RETURNS$
 * The row object.
 *
 * $DESCRIPTION$
 * Pass the row as the parent of its child controls. It places them side by side in creation order. Children with `:grow := .T.` share the remaining width.
